title: A guest edits and saves a file with a byte order mark and one with mixed line ends: the host's files keep both
folders: share-odd
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-odd is shared, 2 files
expect-log: saved .*bom\.txt
expect-log: saved .*mixed\.txt
expect-file: share-odd\bom.txt :: ^one\r\ntwoX\r\n$
expect-file: share-odd\mixed.txt :: ^a\r\nbX\nc\r\nd\n$

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 16000
fit
wait 1200
mark host-after
wait 5000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
edit bom.txt 2 1
key end
type X
wait 500
key save
wait 2000
edit mixed.txt 2 1
key end
type X
wait 500
key save
wait 2000
fit
wait 1200
mark after
wait 2000
quit
wait 1500
